title ALES160 — Lotus's stereo_envelope: the envelope follower carried into stereo, one linked detector
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Lotus (ALES) ladder; approve my own design round; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at the custody gates.
think Read REMEMBER (living edge), the 1,024-round itinerary, and the six-season double-seat. The living ALES ladder (Season C, Lotus) fills one DSP function per signed round; ALES159 (stereo_expand) completed the stereo MEMORYLESS dynamics quartet (gate · compress · limit · expand).
think Lindy-first crux-first: the mono family crossed the same seam at ALES52 — the envelope follower, the time base that opened attack/release dynamics. The next durable rung is its stereo lift, and every stereo *_env rung to come will read it. So the crux is stereo_envelope — one LINKED detector.
think The single stereo truth: the detector is SHARED. The envelope steps toward the linked peak max(|left|, |right|) clamped to the rail (the louder channel decides), and the one curve is written to BOTH channels, so left == right after — the detector aligned across the field. Following each channel by its own magnitude would give two curves and pump the image, the dynamic twin of the ALES129 bug.
think Faithful reuse: stereo_env_step computes the clamped linked key and DELEGATES to ALES52's proven env_step, so the forced-unit-step exact-reach guarantee and the attack/release asymmetry are reused whole. StereoEnvelopeError = envelope.EnvelopeError (BadCoeff, BadRange) reused whole; the linked detector adds no fault.
obs Six laws proven on metal: the linked-detector law (both channels equal ALES52's mono follow of a synthetic per-sample linked-key clip byte for byte, and equal to each other, the independent per-channel follow genuinely differing); balance (left == right, length held); instantaneous (unit attack+release = the linked peak, |-32768| clamped to 32767); convergence (a steady 8000 reached exactly and monotone from silence, a 10000→2000 linked peak eased down to exactly 2000, both tracking); faster-attack monotone; carry (split == whole on both); silence / atomicity (four refusals leave both channels untouched and balanced) / degenerate (count 0 identity).
obs Purely local, siloed to lotus/. One shared i64 envelope bounded in [0, sample_max] which fits i16 — nothing on the path overflows. The curve is not yet routed into a gain; wiring the linked envelope into the stereo compressor/gate/limiter/expander is the next rung. No custody gate reached — a self-approved design round.
loom witness=ales_stereo_envelope_witness green=1 module=lotus/stereo_envelope.rye laws=6
