file lotus/stereo_envelope.rye the linked stereo envelope follower — stereo_env_step, stereo_follow_carry, stereo_follow
file tools/ales_stereo_envelope_witness.rish the trilingual witness (EN · Radiant · TAME), build + selftest GREEN gate
recommend keep-going — the next ALES rung wires the linked envelope into a stereo attack/release dynamics rung (stereo_compress_env), the mechanical continuation of the time-varying family; single-module, policy written, no seam.
